          {
            "title": "Find a Course Lesson",
            "id": 152252,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ein Kurs kann viele Lektionen enthalten, daher identifiziert ein Routenwert den Kurs und ein anderer seine Lektionen.</p><p>Verschachtelte Routen halten beide Werte neben den Ressourcen, die sie identifizieren.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requests\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"course = \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"lesson = \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"f&quot;https://mimo.org/courses/\" /><text value=\"{course}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"/lessons/\" /><text value=\"{lesson}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"response = requests.get(url)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"data = response.json()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(data)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &quot;id&quot;: 4,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &quot;title&quot;: &quot;Working with APIs&quot;,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &quot;course_id&quot;: 12\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></output></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Add the Course ID",
            "id": 152253,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jeder Routenparameter hat eine bestimmte Position in der URL, basierend auf der Ressource, die er identifiziert.</p><p>Füge die Kurs-ID nach <code>/courses</code> und die Lektions-ID nach <code>/lessons</code> in die URL ein.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requests\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"course = \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"lesson = \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"f&quot;https://mimo.org/courses/\" /><text value=\"{course}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"/lessons/\" /><text value=\"{lesson}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"response = requests.get(url)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"data = response.json()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(data)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option startIndex=\"74\" endIndex=\"80\" /><option startIndex=\"91\" endIndex=\"97\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &quot;id&quot;: 4,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &quot;title&quot;: &quot;Working with APIs&quot;,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &quot;course_id&quot;: 12\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>course</code>, gefolgt von <code>lesson</code> und schließlich <code>course</code>, <code>lesson</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jeder Routenparameter hat eine bestimmte Position in der URL, basierend auf der Ressource, die er identifiziert.</p><p>Speichere <code>12</code> in <code>course</code> und <code>4</code> in <code>lesson</code>. Rufe diese Lektion in diesem Kurs ab.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requests\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"course = \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"lesson = \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"f&quot;https://mimo.org/courses/\" /><text value=\"{course}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"/lessons/\" /><text value=\"{lesson}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"response = requests.get(url)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"data = response.json()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(data)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option startIndex=\"74\" endIndex=\"80\" /><option startIndex=\"91\" endIndex=\"97\" /><option startIndex=\"121\" endIndex=\"124\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"post\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"data\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &quot;id&quot;: 4,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &quot;title&quot;: &quot;Working with APIs&quot;,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &quot;course_id&quot;: 12\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>course</code>, gefolgt von <code>lesson</code>, <code>course</code>, <code>lesson</code> und schließlich <code>get</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Add the Nested Resource",
            "id": 152254,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Der Name der verschachtelten Ressource folgt dem Kurswert.</p><p>Vervollständige den Code, um sicherzustellen, dass die Zahl <code>12</code> als Kurs-ID und die Zahl <code>4</code> als Lektions-ID in der URL verwendet wird.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requests\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"course = \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"lesson = \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"f&quot;https://mimo.org/courses/\" /><text value=\"{course}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"/lessons/\" /><text value=\"{lesson}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"response = requests.get(url)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"data = response.json()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(data)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"89\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &quot;id&quot;: 4,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &quot;title&quot;: &quot;Working with APIs&quot;,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &quot;course_id&quot;: 12\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>courses</code>, gefolgt von <code>lessons</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Der Name der verschachtelten Ressource folgt dem Kurswert.</p><p>Vervollständige den Code, um sicherzustellen, dass die Zahl <code>12</code> als Kurs-ID und die Zahl <code>4</code> als Lektions-ID in der URL verwendet wird.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requests\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"course = \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"lesson = \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"f&quot;https://mimo.org/courses/\" /><text value=\"{course}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"/lessons/\" /><text value=\"{lesson}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"response = requests.get(url)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"data = response.json()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(data)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"74\" endIndex=\"80\" /><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"89\" /><option startIndex=\"91\" endIndex=\"97\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"users\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"certificates\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &quot;id&quot;: 4,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &quot;title&quot;: &quot;Working with APIs&quot;,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  &quot;course_id&quot;: 12\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>courses</code>, gefolgt von <code>course</code>, 